PROVENANCE NOTE
---------------
Each dataset carries a .provenance.json stamp recording the SHA-256 fingerprint
of the simulation source that produced it and the UTC generation time. Datasets
whose fingerprint does not match the current source are reported as STALE by
paper/scripts/analyze_results.py and should not be treated as reproducing the
committed code.
